Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.53,0:00:07.49,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:18.67,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:23.51,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.42,0:00:27.11,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:34.55,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:41.09,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.73,0:00:49.07,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.24,0:00:55.34,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:00:59.11,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:03.85,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.26,0:01:10.13,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:21.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:15.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城主大人…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.57,0:02:34.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是黑巫女 椿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.70,0:02:36.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是前来阻挠咒术的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.84,0:02:38.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.41,0:02:40.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诅咒老早就结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:43.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是那样的 我是来接你的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.18,0:02:45.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是妖怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.25,0:02:47.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:51.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是难伺候的老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.62,0:02:54.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们想借用一下那股力量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:57.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪找我有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.56,0:03:00.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还很痛恨桔梗对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.06,0:03:05.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.93,0:03:12.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第60话 黑巫女 五十年的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.38,0:03:24.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.55,0:03:28.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:30.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.29,0:03:33.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:37.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一个你念念看 日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.31,0:03:50.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前学过的也忘光了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:53.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像愈来愈被抛在后面了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:57.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇没什么精神呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:04:00.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是那个 旧男友的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:02.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个明明劈腿甩掉戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.82,0:04:05.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又爱吃醋的暴力任性男人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:07.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是还牵扯不清
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.47,0:04:14.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打起精神嘛 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.17,0:04:17.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点忘了他比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:19.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是嘛 那个臭男人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:21.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男人…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:23.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.94,0:04:25.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他果然不想分手对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.35,0:04:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要干脆点分了才行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.28,0:04:29.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊…那个呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.02,0:04:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们两个…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.78,0:04:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又发生什么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:34.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像又和好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.59,0:04:38.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又回到原点了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.16,0:04:40.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和那个男的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.53,0:04:42.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实他也有温柔的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.96,0:04:43.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:45.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很平常嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.17,0:04:47.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么这么沮丧呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.40,0:04:49.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我最近一直请假
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:50.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,课业有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.90,0:04:54.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此 因为戈薇常常请假
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:57.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算每天上课也有可能跟不上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.91,0:04:59.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:05.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是只要确实做好预习与复习
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.19,0:05:07.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上课就能很快乐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.06,0:05:10.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么怎么怎么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:12.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了不好的话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.63,0:05:13.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:15.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为步美一直很认真
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:17.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:18.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是太晚的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:20.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙又会跑来接我的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.57,0:05:22.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还会来接你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.57,0:05:24.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那真的是很体贴的男朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.14,0:05:27.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对 他明明很爱吃醋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.34,0:05:29.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且很任性
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.71,0:05:31.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.21,0:05:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们又和好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.28,0:05:36.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇这样没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:38.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:46.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是致密的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.09,0:05:49.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧了 老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.47,0:06:00.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 我找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.31,0:06:01.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:05.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.25,0:06:09.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找我来到底有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:12.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大约五十年前 你应该还记得
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:14.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾和叫做桔梗的巫女战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:17.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了夺取四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:19.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的真清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:21.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是很久以前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:22.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:24.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那邪恶的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:27.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿意为我所用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.33,0:06:28.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:32.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借给你力量 我能得到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.21,0:06:33.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就给你四魂之玉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.07,0:06:35.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:57.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:07:00.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你的手上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.30,0:07:01.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老太婆变的妖怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:04.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意你的口气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.61,0:07:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我本来的面貌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.17,0:07:08.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这个女人的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:10.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为了永保青春
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:12.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把魂魄出卖给妖怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.88,0:07:15.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且对方还是不怎样的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:19.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女人应该渴望更强的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:21.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你说有四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.89,0:07:23.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就先让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:26.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算用四魂之玉做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:30.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会是永保青春吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.27,0:07:38.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你希望我做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.64,0:07:42.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是给七宝的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是犬夜叉喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.78,0:07:48.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别只顾着拿零嘴…拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.22,0:07:50.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像这样的也该带一些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:52.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.79,0:07:56.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有很多各式各样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:07:58.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.29,0:08:00.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.59,0:08:02.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,御神酒和护身符也带去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:05.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些不用了啦 爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.43,0:08:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:13.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 你已经要出发了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.17,0:08:14.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为有人在等呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:16.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是犬夜叉哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.51,0:08:17.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都在等
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.88,0:08:20.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想试着去战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.95,0:08:23.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你去了 因为你是胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.25,0:08:24.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就会想回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.95,0:08:26.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.39,0:08:28.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草太年纪还太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.19,0:08:29.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐就不会怕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.19,0:08:33.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概都已经习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.43,0:08:37.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好重
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.83,0:08:39.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题吧 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:43.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:46.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个就放着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.48,0:08:52.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有够久耶 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:56.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明说太阳下山前就会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.35,0:08:58.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇好慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.85,0:09:02.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明说太阳下山前就会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.09,0:09:08.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.23,0:09:09.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.37,0:09:14.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:16.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:19.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有感觉到什么吧 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.74,0:09:21.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.35,0:09:32.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有股奇怪的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.16,0:09:41.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.13,0:09:44.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.53,0:09:46.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是法师啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.53,0:09:48.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您也发现了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:51.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊…邪气悄悄的接近中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.51,0:09:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仿佛在地面上爬一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.18,0:09:57.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:09:58.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.05,0:10:05.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好重喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:12.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:15.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？被咬了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.93,0:10:20.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.54,0:10:25.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没有呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:28.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 很慢耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:29.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.78,0:10:31.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道被什么东西咬了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.31,0:10:32.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.92,0:10:38.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.32,0:10:41.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:45.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纸？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.85,0:11:07.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿到那女人的血了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.81,0:11:09.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完成了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.45,0:11:10.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.72,0:11:13.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 再带我过去一趟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.25,0:11:14.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很神气嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:28.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我碰到一个奇怪的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.87,0:11:31.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该算是解决掉了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:47.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来就交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:49.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 随便你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.05,0:12:14.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:16.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是没有被咬的痕迹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:17.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.68,0:12:19.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.42,0:12:21.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确有个奇怪的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.89,0:12:24.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看那纸 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.79,0:12:25.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.43,0:12:30.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来 戈薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.70,0:12:32.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有带来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:37.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.57,0:12:40.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:45.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.32,0:12:50.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个大家一起吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:52.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是…式神
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,式神？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.59,0:12:58.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚是…四魂之玉碎片？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.09,0:13:00.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 戈薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.43,0:13:01.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.43,0:13:07.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碎片变黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.11,0:13:17.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.98,0:13:19.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.61,0:13:23.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碎片 进入了我的身体里？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.49,0:13:31.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进入那女人体内的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.39,0:13:34.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会和充满奈落污秽的玉共鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.49,0:13:36.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而侵蚀那个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是心灵还是身体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.74,0:13:42.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么一来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:46.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人的命运就任我摆布了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.77,0:13:50.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿 别小看那个叫戈薇的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:51.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笑死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.88,0:13:52.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫戈薇的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.91,0:13:55.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连自己中了诅咒都没发觉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:58.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本以为桔梗的转世
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:14:00.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个多厉害的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.89,0:14:01.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 你想怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.16,0:14:03.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样直接咒杀她也行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:05.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:11.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让犬夜叉的恶梦再次重现吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.53,0:14:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那与心爱的女人相互残杀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:15.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人怀念的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:17.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:19.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.14,0:14:20.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.81,0:14:22.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥 这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:24.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加上之前的邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:27.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是某人在诅咒戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.15,0:14:31.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁敢诅咒戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.55,0:14:34.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是黑巫女的杰作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:36.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在井边咬伤戈薇的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.46,0:14:39.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是黑巫女的使魔 式神
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.53,0:14:40.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.69,0:14:42.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.30,0:14:45.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该也知道她们的存在吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.57,0:14:48.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专门接受诅咒委托的邪恶巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.84,0:14:50.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片受到污染
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:52.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是那家伙的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.71,0:14:55.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全进入戈薇的身体里了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:56.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.34,0:14:58.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇或许会被碎片的毒毒死
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:00.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:04.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找出黑巫女然后打倒她
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.45,0:15:06.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要断绝诅咒非这样做不可
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:08.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.49,0:15:10.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:13.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你留下来陪在戈薇身边
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:15.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样比较妥当
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.86,0:15:16.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.01,0:15:26.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从这个方向可以感受到邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.61,0:15:30.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐上来 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:36.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:39.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:43.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.72,0:15:44.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:46.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.23,0:15:47.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了谁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:51.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了犬夜叉 杀了犬夜叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.91,0:16:00.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:01.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.01,0:16:03.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.41,0:16:04.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了谁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.01,0:16:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了犬夜叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.51,0:16:10.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要…别说了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:18.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然还任性的抵抗着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:20.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个叫戈薇的女人 是巫女桔梗的转世
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:26.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,普通的手段是行不通的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:30.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.44,0:16:33.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.94,0:16:36.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时候的桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.31,0:16:38.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被一个半妖男人夺去了心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:40.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灵力也衰弱了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.95,0:16:43.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夺取那家伙守护的四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.55,0:16:45.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这原本是最好的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:54.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.20,0:16:59.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人竟然把我放的式神
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.93,0:17:01.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原封不动的打回来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.14,0:17:09.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快滚 我不想取你性命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.91,0:17:13.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人故作清高的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:17.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在回想起来仍让我作呕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.36,0:17:28.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:30.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:32.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:43.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我去换个水
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.79,0:17:53.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.89,0:17:55.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.40,0:18:04.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇还有救吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:07.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊…可能戈薇本身
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.90,0:18:10.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正在和诅咒战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:12.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇是很坚强的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.67,0:18:14.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.61,0:18:18.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 再拖下去会承受不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:24.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还束手无策吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.62,0:18:26.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算她垂死挣扎也差不多到极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:32.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.89,0:18:35.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就实现你的愿望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:42.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:45.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒他们还没 抵达黑巫女的所在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:01.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.45,0:19:04.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇明明这么痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:06.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我居然只能旁观
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:19.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:34.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死吧 犬夜叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.72,0:19:37.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.15,0:19:40.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.46,0:19:43.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:44.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:48.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:50.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:54.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是顽强
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.73,0:19:56.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使身体被操纵
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:19:58.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己的心却还没丧失
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.97,0:20:03.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 这样更有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.44,0:20:08.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿 如果犬夜叉逃离那地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.18,0:20:13.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候就不用客气 咒杀戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.65,0:20:14.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.56,0:20:18.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇一定是被黑巫女操纵了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:28.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没好吗 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:31.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪气愈来愈强了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.17,0:20:33.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.45,0:20:41.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.46,0:20:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.03,0:20:55.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.61,0:21:08.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.75,0:21:23.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:25.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经和它战斗过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.83,0:21:35.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人我随时都能咒杀她
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.57,0:21:39.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:42.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样让戈薇杀了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:45.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是逃走 让戈薇丧命呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.38,0:21:49.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快…逃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.59,0:21:54.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.06,0:21:59.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽量痛苦吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.59,0:22:01.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点逃
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.49,0:22:03.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.43,0:22:30.43,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.94,0:22:41.91,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.19,0:22:49.39,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.46,0:22:53.16,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.26,0:22:57.89,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.10,0:23:04.44,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.64,0:23:11.94,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.12,0:23:19.68,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.49,0:23:27.12,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.96,0:23:34.96,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.15,0:23:49.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘在倒下之前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.98,0:23:51.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾经说她被什么咬了一口
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.05,0:23:54.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可能就是黑巫女的式神
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.65,0:23:55.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师快点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.89,0:23:58.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽快找到她的所在位置 然后阻止她
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.26,0:23:59.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然戈薇会将犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是这个结界太强了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.76,0:24:03.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光凭我的力量是不够的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.66,0:24:04.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
